  {
   "copper": 40,
   "description": "Gor Drazhak offers public workspaces, trainers and repairs beyond Sunscar's camp. At level 10, follow the road to Thorga Roadspeaker in the skull hall. Its surrounding country is level 20\u201330, so avoid the wildlife and keep to the route. Speak with Thorga and complete this introduction there.",
